      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Angioplasty of right internal mammary artery grafts may present problems because of the variable origin of the mammary artery and its angulation from the subclavian artery. We report a case of successful angioplasty using a custom designed guide catheter, after failed attempts using conventional guide catheters."},
